---
import ContentPageLayout from '../../layouts/ContentPageLayout.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../../components/SectionHeader.astro';
import FeatureItem from '../../components/FeatureItem.astro';
---

<ContentPageLayout
  title="Consulting & Advisory | Fighting Smart Cyber"
  description="Comprehensive cybersecurity consulting and strategic advisory services. Gap analysis, assessments, capability development, and strategic guidance using the DOTMLPF-P framework."
  heroTitle='Consulting & <span class="highlight">Advisory</span>'
  heroSubtitle="Comprehensive assessments and strategic guidance from proven operators"
  ctaTitle="Ready for Strategic Guidance?"
  ctaDescription="Let's identify the gaps in your cybersecurity posture and design a roadmap for improvement."
  ctaPrimaryButton={{ text: 'Schedule Consultation', href: '/contact' }}
  ctaSecondaryButton={{ text: 'View All Solutions', href: '/solutions' }}
>
  <section class="bg-image-section overlay-left">
    <img src="/images/site/consulting-boardroom.jpg" alt="" class="bg-image" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="bg-image-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="bg-content">
        <h2>Identify Operational Gaps</h2>
          <p>Our cybersecurity consulting services help network owners, <span class="tooltip-trigger">CISOs<span class="tooltip-inline">Chief Information Security Officers</span></span>, <span class="tooltip-trigger">IT<span class="tooltip-inline">Information Technology</span></span> leaders, and mission owners identify operational gaps in their cyber posture using the <span class="tooltip-trigger">DOTMLPF-P<span class="tooltip-inline">Doctrine, Organization, Training, Materiel, Leadership, Personnel, Facilities, Policy</span></span> framework.</p>
          <p>We don't just look at technology—we evaluate your entire cybersecurity ecosystem across doctrine, organization, training, materiel, leadership, personnel, facilities, and policy.</p>
          <h3>Our Consulting Services</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Cyber Readiness Assessments</strong> - Comprehensive gap analysis across all DOTMLPF-P domains</li>
            <li><strong>On-Prem, Cloud, and Hybrid Assessments</strong> - Evaluate your entire infrastructure</li>
            <li><strong>Cyber Range Design and Implementation</strong> - Build training and testing environments</li>
            <li><strong><span class="tooltip-trigger">SOC<span class="tooltip-inline">Security Operations Center</span></span> and Enterprise Architecture Modernization</strong> - Design next-generation security operations</li>
            <li><strong>Compliance and Accreditation Support</strong> - Navigate <span class="tooltip-trigger">NIST<span class="tooltip-inline">National Institute of Standards and Technology</span></span>, <span class="tooltip-trigger">CMMC<span class="tooltip-inline">Cybersecurity Maturity Model Certification</span></span>, <span class="tooltip-trigger">FedRAMP<span class="tooltip-inline">Federal Risk and Authorization Management Program</span></span>, and other frameworks</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-grid">
        <div class="content-text">
          <h2>Strategic Advisory</h2>
          <p>Our advisory services help organizations develop comprehensive cybersecurity capabilities, design effective organizational structures, and navigate complex acquisition and compliance requirements.</p>
          <p>We bring the perspective of leaders who've commanded cyber operations, built security operations centers, and navigated government acquisition processes.</p>
          <h3>Advisory Services</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Capability Development</strong> - Design and implement SOC, <span class="tooltip-trigger">C2<span class="tooltip-inline">Command and Control</span></span>, and cyber range capabilities</li>
            <li><strong>Organizational Design</strong> - Structure security teams for maximum effectiveness</li>
            <li><strong>Acquisition Strategy</strong> - Navigate government procurement and vendor selection</li>
            <li><strong>Zero Trust Roadmaps</strong> - Design and implement Zero Trust architectures</li>
            <li><strong>Cloud Modernization</strong> - Strategic guidance for cloud security transformation</li>
            <li><strong>Executive Advisory</strong> - C-level coaching and strategic planning</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section-alt dark-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <SectionHeader title="The DOTMLPF-P Advantage" description="Most cybersecurity assessments focus only on technology. We take a holistic approach." />
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <FeatureItem
          title="Doctrine"
          description="Are your policies and procedures aligned with best practices and operational reality?"
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Organization"
          description="Is your structure optimized for effective cybersecurity operations and response?"
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Training"
          description="Do your teams have the skills they need to defend against real-world threats?"
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Materiel"
          description="Are your tools, platforms, and technologies effective and properly integrated?"
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Leadership"
          description="Is strategic direction clear, actionable, and supported with the right resources?"
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Personnel"
          description="Do you have the right people in the right roles with the right authorities?"
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Facilities"
          description="Is your infrastructure secure, resilient, and capable of supporting your mission?"
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Policy"
          description="Are governance and compliance frameworks effective and enforceable?"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <SectionHeader title="What You Get" description="From tactical assessment to strategic transformation" />
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <FeatureItem
          title="Comprehensive Assessment"
          description="Detailed evaluation of your cybersecurity posture across all DOTMLPF-P domains, with actionable recommendations."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Operational Focus"
          description="We evaluate solutions based on real-world operational effectiveness, not just compliance checkboxes."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Strategic Roadmap"
          description="Clear, prioritized roadmap for improving your cybersecurity posture with realistic resource requirements."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Executive Briefings"
          description="Clear, concise briefings for leadership that translate technical findings into business impact."
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dark-section">
    <div class="container">
      <SectionHeader title="Why Our Advisory is Different" />
      <div class="content-grid">
        <div class="content-text">
          <p>Most cybersecurity advisors are career consultants. Our team includes:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>A retired three-star general</strong> with strategic command experience</li>
            <li><strong>Operational leaders</strong> who've built and run capabilities in production</li>
            <li><strong>Acquisition experts</strong> who understand government procurement</li>
            <li><strong>Technical specialists</strong> who can bridge strategy and execution</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="content-text">
          <p>We don't just provide recommendations—we help you implement them. Our advisory services often lead to platform deployments, training programs, or capability development projects.</p>
          <p>From initial assessment through full implementation, we stay engaged to ensure your investment delivers operational results.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ContentPageLayout>
